OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start for most, with
OL,6,Fthe best of the sunshine towards the
OL,7,Fwest. Remaining dry with light winds
OL,8,Fthroughout. Feeling cooler than
OL,9,Fyesterday, although temperatures will
OL,10,Fbe close to average for the time of
OL,11,Fyear.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FClearer skies further west,
OL,14,Fturning cloudier from the east, with
OL,15,Fperhaps the odd light shower. Chilly,
OL,16,Fwith a touch of frost in places and
OL,17,Ffog patches developing under light
OL,18,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
