OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA cloudier day on Tuesday,
OL,6,Fwith the chance of a light shower. The
OL,7,Ffar west holding onto the sunshine and
OL,8,Fremaining dry. Temperatures, around
OL,9,Faverage and feeling similar to
OL,10,Fyesterday.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,13,FLargely drier on Wednesday, with sunny
OL,14,Fspells. Those showers returning from
OL,15,Fthe east on Thursday into Friday,
OL,16,Fremaining light. Breezier along the
OL,17,Fcoast on Thursday. Chilly nights with
OL,18,Ffrost possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
